      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{sector}}&=\\frac{90}{360}\\pi(1)^2\\\\A_{\\text{sector}}&=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\A_{\\text{triangle}}&=\\frac12\\times1\\times1\\\\A_{\\text{triangle}}&=\\frac12\\\\A_{\\text{shaded}}&=\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
